{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Patch me if you can is a puzzle adventure where you dive into a game world, freely manipulate objects, and embark on an epic quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find the Bugs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover broken objects scattered throughout the game world using glitch vision. Click on pink, flickering items to open their status window and manipulate them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manipulate Objects at Will</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip light, rotation, scale, or control blocks in the status window to freely alter objects. Shrink boulders, move the sun, or experiment with clever combinations to reshape the game world and solve puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rescue Your Kidnapped Daughter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your beloved daughter is trapped in a bug-riddled game world. As a game developer and father, you must outwit the cunning Lord\u2019s conspiracy, using creativity and courage to save her.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827840?t=1751962330","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827840?t=1751962330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/2f63335e72565a058cb53b8b56418d3ba27282c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751962330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/2f63335e72565a058cb53b8b56418d3ba27282c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751962330","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Patch me if you can is a puzzle adventure where you dive 